    },
    "On Mac this location is off at first. Open System Settings ▸ General ▸ Login Items & Extensions ▸ File Providers and turn on Psynguechthyngue. Closing the window stops syncing; minimize it to keep syncing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Mac 上，此位置默认未启用。请打开 系统设置 ▸ 通用 ▸ 登录项与扩展 ▸ 文件提供程序，启用 Psynguechthyngue。关闭窗口会停止同步，最小化窗口可继续同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Mac, syncing continues while the window is open or minimized. Closing the window quits the app and stops syncing." : {
      "localizations" : {
